<style>
  :root {
    --font-family: "<%= (session && session.fontStyle ? String(session.fontStyle).trim() : 'Inter') %>", sans-serif;
    --primary: #01535b;
    --primary-light: #e8f4f5;
    --border: #e5e7eb;
    --text: #1f2937;
    --text-muted: #6b7280;
    --bg: #f9fafb;
  }

  body {
    font-family: var(--font-family);
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0;
    background-color: var(--bg);
    line-height: 1.7;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }

  main {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 80px 24px 60px;
  }

  .page-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .page-header p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .legal-section {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 28px 28px 24px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .legal-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .section-num {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--primary-light);
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .legal-section p {
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .legal-section ul {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .legal-section li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .legal-section li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 8px;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--primary);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .contact-card {
    background: var(--primary-light);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px 28px;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .contact-card p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .contact-card a {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .contact-card a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    main { padding: 84px 16px 40px; }
    .page-header h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
    .legal-section { padding: 20px 18px; }
    .contact-card { padding: 18px 20px; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    main { padding: 100px 14px 32px; }
    .page-header h1 { font-size: 1.35rem; }
    .page-header p { font-size: 0.88rem; }
    .legal-section { padding: 16px 14px; border-radius: 10px; }
    .legal-section h2 { font-size: 1.02rem; }
    .legal-section p { font-size: 0.92rem; }
    .legal-section li { font-size: 0.9rem; padding-left: 20px; }
    .section-num { width: 24px; height: 24px; font-size: 0.78rem; }
    .contact-card { padding: 16px; border-radius: 10px; }
    .contact-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; }
  }
</style>

</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <div class="page-header">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>Last updated: February 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="section-num">1</span> Introduction</h2>
      <p>Welcome to Managira — a comprehensive school management platform built for educational institutions, government bodies, educators, parents, and guardians. Protecting your privacy is our top priority. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your personal data while ensuring compliance with international privacy standards.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="section-num">2</span> Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We collect the following types of data to deliver and improve our services:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Institutional Information:</strong> When schools or hub operators register, we collect the institution's name, contact details, and administrator credentials.</li>
        <li><strong>Personal Information:</strong> Teachers, staff, parents, and guardians may provide names, email addresses, phone numbers, and other relevant details during account setup.</li>
        <li><strong>Student Data:</strong> Academic records including grades, attendance, behaviour notes, and learning progress — used exclusively for educational monitoring and reporting.</li>
        <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Information about how users interact with Managira, such as IP addresses, device information, browser type, and access patterns, to improve platform performance.</li>
        <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> We use cookies and similar technologies to enhance your experience, remember preferences, and analyse platform usage.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="section-num">3</span> How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Service Delivery:</strong> Managing student records, generating reports, tracking attendance, and enabling communication between schools, parents, and guardians.</li>
        <li><strong>Hub Operations:</strong> Allowing government institutions and educational bodies to oversee multiple schools, monitor performance, and coordinate across their network.</li>
        <li><strong>Communication:</strong> Sending important notifications, announcements, and updates about the platform and policy changes.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> Analysing usage data to improve features, performance, and reliability of the platform.</li>
        <li><strong>Legal Compliance:</strong> Meeting regulatory obligations and responding to lawful requests from authorities.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="section-num">4</span> Data Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
      <p>Managira only shares personal data in controlled and transparent ways:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Schools and Educators:</strong> Authorised school staff can access student records to facilitate education and assessment.</li>
        <li><strong>Parents and Guardians:</strong> Schools may grant families access to their children's academic records, grades, and school updates through the Parent Portal.</li>
        <li><strong>Hub Operators:</strong> Government institutions or educational bodies managing multiple schools through Managira's Hub system can access aggregated data across their member organisations.</li>
        <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> We may work with select partners for hosting, payment processing, and email delivery. These providers are bound by strict confidentiality agreements.</li>
        <li><strong>Legal Obligations:</strong> We may disclose information if required by law, regulation, or legal proceedings.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="section-num">5</span> Data Security</h2>
      <p>We implement industry-standard measures to protect all personal and institutional data:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Encryption:</strong> All data is encrypted in transit (TLS/SSL) and at rest.</li>
        <li><strong>Access Controls:</strong> Role-based permissions ensure only authorised users can access specific data.</li>
        <li><strong>Secure Infrastructure:</strong> Data is stored on Amazon Web Services (AWS) with strict access policies and regular security audits.</li>
        <li><strong>Vulnerability Scanning:</strong> We use automated tools (including Snyk and OWASP best practices) to continuously monitor for security threats.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>While we take every precaution, no online system can guarantee complete security. We encourage users to maintain strong passwords and report any suspicious activity immediately.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="section-num">6</span> Data Retention</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We retain personal and student data for as long as the school or hub actively uses Managira.</li>
        <li>If a school terminates its account, data will be archived for a legally required period before permanent deletion.</li>
        <li>Users may request data deletion at any time, subject to applicable regulations and institutional policies.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="section-num">7</span> Your Rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the following rights regarding your data:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Access and Correction:</strong> Request access to your personal data and ask for corrections if needed.</li>
        <li><strong>Data Deletion:</strong> Request deletion of data that is no longer needed for the purposes it was collected.</li>
        <li><strong>Opt-Out:</strong> Manage cookie preferences and opt out of non-essential data collection.</li>
        <li><strong>Data Portability:</strong> Request structured copies of your data for use in other systems.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="section-num">8</span> Compliance</h2>
      <p>Managira adheres to international data protection standards including:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>GDPR</strong> — General Data Protection Regulation (EU)</li>
        <li><strong>FERPA</strong> — Family Educational Rights and Privacy Act (US)</li>
        <li><strong>COPPA</strong> — Children's Online Privacy Protection Act (US)</li>
        <li><strong>Data Protection Act</strong> — Applicable national data protection laws</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-section">
      <h2><span class="section-num">9</span> Policy Updates</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Users will be notified of significant changes through the platform. Continued use of Managira after updates are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-card">
      <p>Questions about your privacy? Contact us at <a href="mailto:support@managira.com">support@managira.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>